# Fisher lockfile — run `fisher update` to install everything listed here.
#
# Intentionally empty of the macOS equivalents: fish ships autosuggestions and
# syntax highlighting built in, so zsh-autosuggestions and
# zsh-syntax-highlighting need no counterpart. The oh-my-zsh `git` plugin is not
# ported either — conf.d/aliases.fish carries our own git aliases instead.
#
# Add a plugin here only when it has a real equivalent in the zsh setup, so the
# two shells do not drift. Fisher itself is listed because it manages itself.
